# SHA-256 of every file the two model servers read, for the model revisions set in .env. Each path starts with the
# server that reads the file:
#   embedder/  APP_EMBEDDING__MODEL, APP_EMBEDDING__REVISION: intfloat/multilingual-e5-small at 614241f622f53c4eeff9890bdc4f31cfecc418b3
#   reranker/  APP_RERANK__MODEL, APP_RERANK__REVISION: cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2 at 233902d25c440f23af6f7d6e94d2946bac0bee0a
# The model-check service mounts models/<model>/<revision>/ of each server under that name and compares the files
# with this list before either server starts.
# These values change only together with a new model or revision: download its files, check onnx/model.onnx
# against the SHA-256 that Hugging Face shows for it, write the new hashes here and change the revision in .env in
# the same commit. If a check fails while nothing was changed, the local files are damaged: download them again,
# never edit the hashes to match them.
